WEBVTT

00:00:08.992 --> 00:00:09.445
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Dad!

00:00:11.031 --> 00:00:13.440
<v><b>Henry:</b></v> Rob, hi!

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:14.480
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Hi.

00:00:18.128 --> 00:00:19.688
This is for you.

00:00:20.429 --> 00:00:21.040
<v><b>Henry:</b></v> For me?

00:00:22.313 --> 00:00:24.725
It’s my favourite wine. Thanks Rob!

00:00:25.412 --> 00:00:26.412
But why?

00:00:26.891 --> 00:00:29.219
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> For your birthday of course! Happy birthday!

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:31.440
<v><b>Henry:</b></v> Rob, it isn’t my birthday today!

00:00:31.805 --> 00:00:33.729
My birthday’s on the 2nd of July.

00:00:34.302 --> 00:00:36.142
Today’s the 2nd of June.

00:00:36.908 --> 00:00:38.448
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Oh no!

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.240
<v><b>Henry:</b></v> Don’t worry.

00:00:40.174 --> 00:00:41.801
Come in! Have a glass of wine…